  "notes": "Blox Fruits is a pirate adventure inspired by One Piece. You join the Pirates or Marines, fight NPCs and bosses across three Seas to level up, and hunt for Devil Fruits that give you powers like fire, ice or light. Along the way you train fighting styles, swords and guns, and pick where your stat points go as you climb toward the max level.\n\nMost Blox Fruits codes give 2x XP for 15 to 30 minutes, plus a few free stat resets and small Beli rewards. The XP boosts help most while you are still leveling, so save them for a session where you can grind quests without breaks. Keep a stat reset for later, since it lets you fix a bad build for free. New codes usually show up with big updates, like-goal events and streamer shoutouts.",
