  "faq": [
    {
      "q": "Do XP codes stack in Blox Fruits?",
      "a": "No. Only one 2x XP boost runs at a time, so redeem the next code after the current timer ends to get full value from each one."
    },
    {
      "q": "When should I use a stat reset code?",
      "a": "Use it when you switch builds, like moving from a sword build to a fruit build. Each reset code works once per account, so hold on to it until you actually need it."
    },
    {
      "q": "Why does a Blox Fruits code say it is invalid or already redeemed?",
      "a": "It has either expired or you already used it on this account. Codes are one use each, and older streamer codes get removed often, so check the list above before trying again."
    }
  ],
